flowchart LR
    Start([City Launches Strategy]) --> Track[Platform Tracks Everything]
    
    Track --> Data1[Cost per Person]
    Track --> Data2[Retention Rate]
    Track --> Data3[Time to Housing]
    Track --> Data4[Vendor Performance]
    
    Data1 --> Dashboard[Real-Time Dashboard]
    Data2 --> Dashboard
    Data3 --> Dashboard
    Data4 --> Dashboard
    
    Dashboard --> Analyze{Performance<br/>Good?}
    
    Analyze -->|Yes| Continue([Keep Current Strategy])
    Analyze -->|No| Alert[Alert City Admin]
    
    Alert --> Review[City Reviews Data]
    Review --> Decide[City Decides to Pivot]
    
    Decide --> Audible[🏈 CALL AUDIBLE]
    Audible --> NewStrategy[Implement New Strategy]
    
    NewStrategy --> Track
    
    style Audible fill:#F44336,stroke:#C62828,stroke-width:3px,color:#fff
    style Dashboard fill:#4CAF50,stroke:#2E7D32,stroke-width:2px

